---
import StudentLayout from '../../layouts/StudentLayout.astro';
---

<StudentLayout pageTitle="Application Prep Studio">
  <div class="space-y-6 max-w-4xl">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Application Preparation Studio
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">
        Document checklists, attested academic dossier templates, and formal recommendation letter drafts tailored for Pakistani university admissions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Attested Documents Checklist -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>📋</span> Mandatory Attested Document Checklist
        </h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
          Standard Higher Education Dossier
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
        <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" defaultChecked class="mt-0.5 rounded text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500" />
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Matric / SSC Certificate & Detailed Marks Sheet</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Attested copy by BISE or Gazetted Officer (BPS-17+).</p>
          </div>
        </label>

        <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" defaultChecked class="mt-0.5 rounded text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500" />
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Intermediate / HSSC Certificate & Transcript</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Pre-Engineering / Pre-Medical / ICS transcript attested.</p>
          </div>
        </label>

        <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" defaultChecked class="mt-0.5 rounded text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500" />
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Official University Semester Transcript / Grade Report</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Verified by Controller of Examinations showing CGPA &ge; cutoff.</p>
          </div>
        </label>

        <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 rounded text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500" />
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Domicile Certificate (Charsadda / KP)</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Issued by District Administration Office confirming provincial domicile.</p>
          </div>
        </label>

        <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 rounded text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500" />
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Parent / Guardian Income Certificate / Salary Slip</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Required for Need-Based & Financial Aid applications (HEC / Ehsaas / MORA).</p>
          </div>
        </label>

        <label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-750 cursor-pointer">
          <input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 rounded text-sky-600 focus:ring-sky-500" />
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">Bonafide Student Certificate</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Signed by Head of Department or Registrar confirming active enrollment.</p>
          </div>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Recommendation Letter Request Template -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>✉️</span> Recommendation Letter Request Template (Faculty Draft)
        </h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">Formal Template</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 rounded-xl font-mono text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 select-all">
        Subject: Recommendation Letter Request — Muhammad Khan (BS Computer Science, Sem 4, CGPA 3.65)<br /><br />
        Respected Professor / Head of Department,<br /><br />
        I hope this message finds you in good health. I am currently enrolled in the 4th semester of the BS Computer Science program at Bacha Khan University Charsadda under student ID student-charsadda-cs-01.<br /><br />
        I am applying for the upcoming merit scholarship / national research internship program. The selection committee requires a formal letter of recommendation testifying to my academic performance, technical aptitude in computer science, and leadership potential.<br /><br />
        Having completed coursework under your esteemed instruction, I would be profoundly grateful if you could provide a letter of recommendation for this submission. The application deadline is approaching, and I have attached my updated CV, semester transcript, and draft statement of purpose for your kind reference.<br /><br />
        Thank you very much for your time, support, and mentorship.<br /><br />
        Respectfully,<br />
        Muhammad Khan<br />
        BS Computer Science • Semester 4
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Statement of Purpose Outline -->
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 shadow-sm space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>✍️</span> Statement of Purpose (SOP) Structural Blueprint
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400">1. Introduction & Motivation</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px]">
            Express enthusiasm for Computer Science, foundational milestones, and specific alignment with the scholarship or research lab.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">2. Academic Record & Projects</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px]">
            Highlight strong CGPA (3.65), coursework excellence, programming projects, and problem-solving contributions.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/40 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700/60 space-y-1">
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">3. Impact & Future Vision</span>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-[11px]">
            State how this funding empowers your completion of degree studies and enables socioeconomic contribution to KP and Pakistan.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StudentLayout>
